ice is going  up the overall trend is that the price  is going up and you can even see that in  July it was $10 and then by June of the  next year it was approaching on and it  looks like it's about almost a little  over $16 maybe almost $17 so it actually  had gone up a lot they don't give us  July of the next year but the overall  trend is definitely on the upwards  direction right over here and you can  see it just visually by looking at this  line graph even those are a few bumps  that go down the overall direction is  upward
 

